
@baseUrl = http://localhost:3000/api/v1
@apiKey = d4s2a0b0a1n4a0l0y7t

### GET - Alle clients ophalen
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients
API_KEY: {{apiKey}}


### GET - Client ophalen op ID
GET {{baseUrl}}/clients/1
API_KEY: {{apiKey}}


### POST - Nieuwe client toevoegen
# Pas de JSON-body aan op basis van je client-schema.
POST {{baseUrl}}/clients
API_KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 999,
    "name": "Test Client",
    "address": "Teststraat 10",
    "city": "Rotterdam",
    "zip_code": "3000 AA",
    "province": "Zuid-Holland",
    "country": "Netherlands",
    "contact_name": "Test Persoon",
    "contact_phone": "0612345678",
    "contact_email": "test@example.com"
}


### PUT - Client aanpassen
# Pas de JSON-body aan op basis van je client-schema.
PUT {{baseUrl}}/clients/999
API_KEY: {{apiKey}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "id": 999,
    "name": "Aangepaste Test Client",
    "address": "Nieuwe Teststraat 20",
    "city": "Rotterdam",
    "zip_code": "3000 BB",
    "province": "Zuid-Holland",
    "country": "Netherlands",
    "contact_name": "Test Persoon",
    "contact_phone": "0612345678",
    "contact_email": "test@example.com"
}


### DELETE - Client verwijderen
DELETE {{baseUrl}}/clients/999
API_KEY: {{apiKey}}
